ive Num 33:56 ( J or H ) Judg 20:5 ; Esth 4:13 absolute Isa 10:7 compare Isa 14:24 think that , followed by object clause (Imperfect without conjunction) Ps 50:21 think of , followed by accusative Ps 48:10 . Hithpa`el make oneself or become like; Imperfect אֶדַּמֶּה לְעֶלְיוֺן Isa 14:14 I will make myself like the Most High (on form compare Ges «GKC:54»§ 54 . 2).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB1961')\">BDB1961</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H1819')\">H1819</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB1960')\">BDB1960</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB1962')\">BDB1962</entry></div><p> I. <bdbheb>דָּמָה</bdbheb> <b>verb</b> <highlightword>be like, resemble</highlightword> (Late Hebrew <highlight>id.</highlight>, Aramaic <bdbarc>דְּמֵי</bdbarc>, <bdbheb>דְּמָא</bdbheb>, <placeholder1155/>; compare <bdbheb>דמין</bdbheb>, <placeholder1156/> <highlight>price</highlight>, Nabataean <bdbheb>דמי</bdbheb> <highlight>id.</highlight> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Nö')\">Nö</lookup> in <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Eut')\">Eut<sup>Nab. Inscr. p. 35</sup></lookup>); also <placeholder1157/>, and <placeholder1158/> <highlight>likeness</highlight> (whence Arabic <placeholder1159/> <highlight>image, effigy</highlight>, as loan-word <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Frä')\">Frä<sup>272</sup></lookup>) compare <bdbheb>דְּמוּת</bdbheb>) — <div class=\"point\"><b>Qal</b> <highlight>Perfect</highlight> 3 masculine singular <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ד</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 31:8\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(26,31,8)\">Ezek 31:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 144:4\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"144\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"144\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(19,144,4)\">Ps 144:4</ref> 3 feminine singular <bdbheb>דָּֽמְתָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Song 7:8\" b=\"22\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(22,7,8)\">Song 7:8</ref> 2 masculine singular <bdbheb>דָּמִיתָ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 31:2\" b=\"26\"